Detector: divide-before-multiply
BequestVault._civilFromDays(uint256) (src/BequestVault.sol#444-453) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- era = z / 146_097 (src/BequestVault.sol#449)
	- doe = z - era * 146_097 (src/BequestVault.sol#449)
BequestVault._civilFromDays(uint256) (src/BequestVault.sol#444-453) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- yoe = (doe - doe / 1460 + doe / 36_524 - doe / 146_096) / 365 (src/BequestVault.sol#449-450)
	- doy = doe - (365 * yoe + yoe / 4 - yoe / 100) (src/BequestVault.sol#450-451)
BequestVault._civilFromDays(uint256) (src/BequestVault.sol#444-453) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- mp = (5 * doy + 2) / 153 (src/BequestVault.sol#451)
	- d = doy - (153 * mp + 2) / 5 + 1 (src/BequestVault.sol#451-452)
Reference: https://github.com/crytic/slither/wiki/Detector-Documentation#divide-before-multiply

